We've lost our main communication lines with our troops on the surface of Titan; only three distress signals remain. We must assume that the CCA has built some new technology that overwhelmed our forces. You and the Recycler Texas will be dropped onto Titan at Nav Beta. Locate the distress beacons and rescue any survivors. We want to hear first hand from them what has happened down there.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Rescue our troops at the three distress beacons.
